{
    "description": "A French 80 mm receipt using the other blocks: merge fields in tenant text (with a quote and an ampersand), a field without its label, a barcode, a QR code, terms, a signature, a dashed divider and a spacer; an unknown block (LAY-07) is skipped, and the fiscal block the template lacks is added because the country pack requires it (TPL-03). Status waiting: the till has not uploaded it yet.",
